---
title: "AgentDesk channel session on its host (tmux, Herdr, process) across restarts"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Run
    lg1: Lost
    lg2: Breaks NoKillByRestart
    lg3: Path to the NoKillByRestart bug
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 pink
  class lg2 breaks
  class lg3 bugPath
  s0: No session
  s1: On Herdr, launched, not bound
  s2: dcserver down, no session, host server down
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s0: a message arrives
  s0 --> s1: a turn launches a new session
  s1 --> s2: dcserver stops
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 blue
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 blue
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 pink
  class s2 breaks
  class s2 bugPath
